OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe rain
OL,6,Fpushing east during this evening,
OL,7,Fturning light and patchy. Mainly dry
OL,8,Fwith clear spells overnight with a
OL,9,Ftouch of frost possible, although a
OL,10,Ffew showers in the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FIt will be a bright day with a
OL,13,Fscattering of showers, the showers
OL,14,Fmainly dying out later. Light
OL,15,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FIt
OL,18,Fwill be mainly dry and settled as high
OL,19,Fpressure dominates. Chilly nights if
OL,20,Fskies remain clear with a frost
OL,21,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
